  "result_json": "{\"executive_summary\":[{\"text\":\"Management reports that total revenue expanded across fiscal periods while operating income improved alongside higher operating margins.\",\"kind\":\"fact\",\"financial_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"2025:revenue\",\"value\":281724000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2025,\"period_start\":\"2024-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2025-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:revenue\",\"value\":331839000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2025:operating_income\",\"value\":128528000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2025,\"period_start\":\"2024-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2025-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:operating_income\",\"value\":155237000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"}],\"passage_citations\":[]},{\"text\":\"Inference: Higher operating income and net income alongside contracting free cash flow suggest that rising capital expenditures outpaced cash generation growth during the period.\",\"kind\":\"inference\",\"financial_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"2025:free_cash_flow\",\"value\":71611000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2025,\"period_start\":\"2024-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2025-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:free_cash_flow\",\"value\":66987000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"}],\"passage_citations\":[]}],\"performance\":[{\"text\":\"Diluted earnings per share increased between the annual reporting periods.\",\"kind\":\"fact\",\"financial_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"2025:diluted_eps\",\"value\":13.64,\"unit\":\"USD/shares\",\"fiscal_year\":2025,\"period_start\":\"2024-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2025-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:diluted_eps\",\"value\":17.95,\"unit\":\"USD/shares\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"}],\"passage_citations\":[]},{\"text\":\"Net income grew significantly across the consecutive annual periods.\",\"kind\":\"fact\",\"financial_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"2025:net_income\",\"value\":101832000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2025,\"period_start\":\"2024-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2025-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:net_income\",\"value\":133749000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"}],\"passage_citations\":[]}],\"what_matters_most\":[{\"text\":\"Management attributes revenue growth primarily to the expansion of Microsoft Cloud offerings, while noting that cloud gross margin percentage decreased due to ongoing investments in artificial intelligence infrastructure and growing product usage.\",\"kind\":\"fact\",\"financial_citations\":[],\"passage_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"sec:9beb34bf0c9ed7847be4b3af\",\"quote\":\"Fiscal Year 2026 Compared with Fiscal Year 2025 Revenue increased $50.1 billion or 18% driven by growth in Microsoft Cloud. Intelligent Cloud revenue increased driven by Azure. Productivity and Business Processes revenue increased driven by Microsoft 365 Commercial cloud. More Personal Computing revenue decreased driven by XBOX (formerly Gaming), offset in part by growth in Search advertising. Cost of revenue increased $18.5 billion or 21% driven by growth in Microsoft Cloud. Gross margin increased $31.6 billion or 16% with growth across each of our segments. \\u2022 Gross margin percentage decreased slightly driven by continued investments in AI infrastructure and growing AI product usage, offset in part by efficiency gains across the Microsoft Cloud. \\u2022 Microsoft Cloud gross margin percentage decreased to 66% driven by continued investments in AI infrastructure and growing AI product usage, offset in part by efficiency gains in Azure and Microsoft 365 Commercial cloud.\"}]},{\"text\":\"Inference: Accelerated spending on property and equipment reflects aggressive scaling of compute capacity to capture emerging artificial intelligence demand, though the ultimate return on these outlays remains unproven by accounting results alone.\",\"kind\":\"inference\",\"financial_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"2025:capital_expenditure\",\"value\":64551000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2025,\"period_start\":\"2024-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2025-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:capital_expenditure\",\"value\":115948000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"}],\"passage_citations\":[]}],\"business_developments\":[{\"text\":\"Management highlights that the company maintains a long-term strategic partnership with OpenAI, which was extended to further advance artificial intelligence and integrate models and infrastructure into products.\",\"kind\":\"fact\",\"financial_citations\":[],\"passage_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"sec:c0fa52be850bb3e3b537360c\",\"quote\":\"We have a long-term strategic partnership with OpenAI which was originally established in 2019. In October 2025 and April 2026, we extended this partnership and continue to build on our shared vision to advance artificial intelligence responsibly and make its benefits broadly accessible. Microsoft is a major investor in OpenAI and will continue to receive revenue-sharing payments. We hold rights to OpenAI\\u2019s intellectual property, including models and infrastructure, for integration into our products.\"}]}],\"capital_allocation\":[{\"text\":\"Operating cash flow rose between fiscal years, but cash expenditures for property and equipment increased at a faster rate, resulting in lower free cash flow.\",\"kind\":\"fact\",\"financial_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"2025:operating_cash_flow\",\"value\":136162000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2025,\"period_start\":\"2024-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2025-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:operating_cash_flow\",\"value\":182935000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2025:capital_expenditure\",\"value\":64551000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2025,\"period_start\":\"2024-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2025-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:capital_expenditure\",\"value\":115948000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2025:free_cash_flow\",\"value\":71611000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2025,\"period_start\":\"2024-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2025-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:free_cash_flow\",\"value\":66987000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"}],\"passage_citations\":[]},{\"text\":\"Management discloses material cash commitments including construction obligations, purchase commitments, and operating and finance lease liabilities supporting future datacenter expansion.\",\"kind\":\"fact\",\"financial_citations\":[],\"passage_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"sec:e6f33df3c9599910faa6ecaa\",\"quote\":\"Contractual Obligations The following table summarizes the payments due by fiscal year for our outstanding contractual obligations as of June 30, 2026: (In millions) 2027 Thereafter Total Long-term debt: (a) Principal payments $ 9,250 $ 36,886 $ 46,136 Interest payments 1,405 24,148 25,553 Construction commitments (b) 29,848 4,718 34,566 Operating and finance leases, including imputed interest (c) 32,411 411,095 443,506 Purchase commitments (d) 169,008 25,052 194,060 Total $ 241,922 $ 501,899 $ 743,821\"}]}],\"investment_considerations\":[{\"text\":\"Inference: While cloud revenue growth demonstrates healthy demand for enterprise software and Azure workloads, the heavy ongoing capital intensity required to maintain competitiveness could constrain near-term free cash flow conversion.\",\"kind\":\"inference\",\"financial_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"2026:revenue\",\"value\":331839000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"},{\"source_id\":\"2026:capital_expenditure\",\"value\":115948000000.0,\"unit\":\"USD\",\"fiscal_year\":2026,\"period_start\":\"2025-07-01\",\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\"}],\"passage_citations\":[]}],\"risks\":[{\"text\":\"Management notes that electricity generation and transmission infrastructure is experiencing increasing demand and capacity constraints, which could restrict datacenter expansion or increase energy costs.\",\"kind\":\"fact\",\"financial_citations\":[],\"passage_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"64cb0d4d978ad6d38165413f\",\"quote\":\"In many regions, electricity generation, transmission, and distribution infrastructure is experiencing increasing demand and capacity constraints. Limitations in power availability, delays in obtaining power connections, outages, shortages, increased energy costs, or requirements imposed by utilities, regulators, or other market participants could restrict our ability to develop or expand datacenter capacity.\"}]},{\"text\":\"Management cautions that competitors offering open-source AI models or free applications could exert pricing pressure and increase research and development costs.\",\"kind\":\"fact\",\"financial_citations\":[],\"passage_citations\":[{\"source_id\":\"sec:cee5d01d4c45f8900753535a\",\"quote\":\"• Some companies compete with us by modifying and then distributing open-source software at little or no cost to end users, developing, making available, or using AI models that are open, and earning revenue on advertising or integrated products and services. These firms do not bear the full costs of research and development for the open-source products. Some open-source products mimic the features and functionality of our products. The competitive pressures described above may cause decreased sales volumes, price reductions, and/or increased operating costs, such as for research and development, marketing, and sales incentives, which could adversely affect our financial condition and results of operations.\"}]}],\"missing_information\":[{\"text\":\"What are the specific return on invested capital metrics and unit economics associated with incremental artificial intelligence infrastructure investments?\",\"kind\":\"question\",\"financial_citations\":[],\"passage_citations\":[]}]}"
